ical path"}, {"id": "32765b49-aa94-40ce-9699-1c2cec73f9d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule compression"}], "description": "Gist: Critical path thinking identifies which delays matter most."}, {"id": "d14c6b26-3807-4da6-97b9-1c122a65c19d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Uncertainty in schedules", "children": [{"id": "7479a5c4-fda0-4124-9bd8-d7dc4946b910", "type": "concept", "title": "Optimistic time"}, {"id": "a4fa8806-2782-4ef9-9a66-1775611b3a34", "type": "concept", "title": "Most likely time"}, {"id": "4668de71-20d2-4e10-a4b6-7bcd4293febc", "type": "concept", "title": "Pessimistic time"}, {"id": "ce58a9bb-1db8-4a71-aab2-fd6f22e6f949", "type": "concept", "title": "Milestone risk"}], "description": "Gist: PERT and scenario thinking help teams plan for duration uncertainty."}]}, {"id": "f19d6e9b-14a9-4c11-8af8-7cbf37cda9d5", "type": "topic", "title": "Cost Estimation, Budgeting, and Earned Value Management", "description": "Connect project plans to budgets, cost baselines, forecasts, variance analysis, and performance reporting.", "children": [{"id": "136597e5-47cf-4537-ad07-5e4055ac3e33", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Estimating methods", "children": [{"id": "e5376c1d-a81c-457a-a906-179234c6c7e3", "type": "concept", "title": "Analogous estimates"}, {"id": "a1f690f2-3052-4de8-83f2-5d87f76143aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Parametric estimates"}, {"id": "153d4e12-5cc0-490f-9ddb-74d8aa24b433", "type": "concept", "title": "Bottom-up estimates"}, {"id": "98a566a0-03be-48ac-b19e-39f52fee80ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Contingency"}], "description": "Gist: Students compare quick estimates with detailed bottom-up cost logic."}, {"id": "39682c3e-a40c-462a-b51a-c317c598a989", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Budget baseline", "children": [{"id": "5adbcd0b-1bd5-4275-9865-93bdcd117fad", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost baseline"}, {"id": "80e62b0d-8b6a-40d0-8083-ac23fc280cf8", "type": "concept", "title": "Management reserve"}, {"id": "a0157b5d-da14-4298-aeea-64ea6d9d89