teams"}, {"id": "3878898d-e956-4325-88f2-f253a5fedd9c", "type": "concept", "title": "Distributed teams"}], "description": "Gist: Team design shapes coordination speed, accountability, and decision quality."}, {"id": "091ae07a-d60f-49dd-96d9-53dcd1c36bc3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capacity constraints", "children": [{"id": "607e4b13-521b-4343-a916-3901fc623d8c", "type": "concept", "title": "Resource leveling"}, {"id": "7eb6fc08-5fcb-4c9f-8068-5cdb19edfd00", "type": "concept", "title": "Resource smoothing"}, {"id": "9f9f38ec-8b62-49b1-860c-90311561ded6", "type": "concept", "title": "Critical chain"}, {"id": "a0609295-cc0b-4e33-b002-a99f07cf30e8", "type": "concept", "title": "WIP limits"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn why bottlenecks and multitasking can damage delivery."}]}, {"id": "4d429be0-b065-4562-8a4e-80fed631ebef", "type": "topic", "title": "Risk, Uncertainty, Issue, and Opportunity Management", "description": "Prepare students to identify, assess, prioritize, respond to, and monitor project risk and uncertainty.", "children": [{"id": "ef4cc00f-c7dc-433b-b1a9-a3cb1a950b25", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk identification", "children": [{"id": "8fdb888f-8cfd-4a1a-8592-632d2ac010db", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk register"}, {"id": "5758ec2f-ad2d-497d-a81e-6bb78ae93c76", "type": "concept", "title": "Cause-risk-effect"}, {"id": "15fe03ba-c693-4c22-9b4e-46861e3b2314", "type": "concept", "title": "Assumptions log"}, {"id": "26fe191e-9080-4c4d-bbf9-e0025372f1db", "type": "concept", "title": "Early warning signs"}], "description": "Gist: Risk work begins by naming uncertain events before they become surprises."}, {"id": "b2003f3c-3a1c-4437-86b9-c1f1d4a41043", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk assessment", "children": [{"id": "ce695b26-c328-4e68-9bf6-836ff795baa3", "type": "concept", "title": "Probability-impact matrix"}, {"id": "c0e7b0b9-f168-49df-a98c-8e513efe7d8d", "type": "concept", "title": "Expected value"}, {"id": "d18bb71f-2af8-4a41-b1fd-906eb5d01a44", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk appetite"}, {"id": "e5c2b088-a4c6-448b-bb58-1261c09571be", "type": "concept", "title": "Sensitivity analysis"}], "description": "Gist: Teams prioritize risk using probability, impact, exposure, and urgency."}, {"id": "deb57544-78f4-4fcd-bd64-96e8d23817af", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk response", "children": [{"id": "7e1e05c8-4361-44ab-86e0-d1a5d25c973b", "type": "concept", "title": "Avoid"}, {"id": "c861e291-cd1b-4e21-9bab-e9a5a58c5364", "type": "concept", "title": "Mitigate"}, {"id": "af1cb0a0-fa35-4d05-bb35-b83770c24d15", "type": "concept", "title": "Transfer"}, {"id": "4d6d0690-f0d3-4a77-a463-869b782b6adf", "type": "concept", "title": "Accept and exploit"}], "description": "Gist: Good projects plan responses and owners before disruption hits."}]}, {"id": "75e86be6-ce8a-4040-8a2e-e8e016fe3243", "type": "topic", "title": "Quality, Testing, Acceptance, and Benefits Realization", "description": "Teach quality planning, verification, validation, acceptance, continuous improvement, and post-project value realization.", "children": [{"id": "c26bdef5-1cfb-47f6-aded-c13eedd7d332", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Quality planning", "children": [{"id": "12467139-1105-472f-baad-be58d714584b", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality standards"}, {"id": "efaf18ea-5443-43d6-abe6-68212895b8af", "type": "concept", "title": "Definition of done"}, {"id": "c28769d4-9bac-4351-a37b-a3b6fef47f15", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality metrics"}, {"id": "cb4f921b-8e61-4e6d-9a07-e47cd79eeaa8", "type": "concept", "title": "Prevention costs"}], "description": "Gist: Quality must be designed into the project, not inspected at the end."}, {"id": "a559ed7e-337b-46eb-ac58-f49726ed7b49", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Verification and validation", "children": [{"id": "5c250f17-da4d-43aa-b370-077a65353045", "type": "concept", "title": "Inspection"}, {"id": "3ef0787d-e070-4349-83b7-ab517edc28b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Testing"}, {"id": "40ecd59a-7066-43f4-b654-c81e4b252bc9", "type": "concept", "title": "Validation"}, {"id": "cee5fdab-e45d-41bb-899a-6862651eb071", "type": "concept", "title": "User acceptance"}], "description": "Gist: Students distinguish building the thing right from building the right thing."}, {"id": "38915cc9-ad60-4a69-94e5-2fb73f574824", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Closure and benefits", "children": [{"id": "431c5fe2-4c6a-49f0-9a08-2f7a444b528d", "type": "concept", "title": "Lessons learned"}, {"id": "79ec4470-6b5d-4696-b842-f0163bb3af99", "type": "concept", "title": "Handoff"}, {"id": "1272b3c8-65cb-40f0-a39f-e11c5bff494b", "type": "concept", "title": "Benefits review"}, {"id": "311ee4a2-f04a-4699-9685-020015aa0b5b", "type": "concept", "title": "Post-implementation audit"}], "description": "Gist: Closure confirms acceptance and transfers value to operations."}]}, {"id": "16648f0a-21c9-478a-b76e-e9feda5b4c74", "type": "topic", "title": "Communication, Leadership, Negotiation, and Conflict", "description": "Develop the human side of project delivery: communication rhythm, influence, team leadership, conflict, and alignment.", "children": [{"id": "3c82a583-9442-4c38-9ce1-51b6e646f8c5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Communication planning", "children": [{"id": "b4d9d490-f0a9-448d-a69f-2ae81f979b6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Communication matrix"}, {"id": "96df0f5c-fcd8-4002-b90d-ffba73ac7e61", "type": "concept", "title": "Status meeting"}, {"id": "6ee9c143-b031-4843-9f39-5da62d432229", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive summary"}, {"id": "5f6f80cc-623f-4f6c-85f1-cdaa909709be", "type": "concept", "title": "Decision log"}], "description": "Gist: Project communication must match stakeholder needs and decision cadence."}, {"id": "101355de-c4d6-46b3-a325-81a10ba55d1c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership", "children": [{"id": "78173378-3b05-422f-a720-841c115e4264", "type": "concept", "title": "Influence"}, {"id": "c7710528-a9c7-470e-b7e8-861445e549bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Motivation"}, {"id": "16060741-7210-4bee-afbe-2bd5097cb9d8", "type": "concept", "title": "Psychological safety"}, {"id": "bf5ebabe-d257-4c02-8260-29e566b52e32", "type": "concept", "title": "Accountability"}], "description": "Gist: Project managers lead without always having formal authority."}, {"id": "86ce15e2-4340-4c43-a48b-5843c484bfa2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Conflict and negotiation", "children": [{"id": "35c5ecbf-c0c2-4684-a1c7-d4a804a2d57b", "type": "concept", "title": "Interest-based negotiation"}, {"id": "d8ab4b55-aaf7-4496-8d89-a8b556a2bf82", "type": "concept", "title": "Tradeoffs"}, {"id": "d1cdc121-7335-4f96-b307-0e5c34dcd6b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Escalation"}, {"id": "3b1ab68a-ac70-4e38-a3c8-4a9301648c9f", "type": "concept", "title": "Alignment"}], "description": "Gist: Conflict is normal when projects compete for scope, time, money, and resources."}]}, {"id": "bee08787-6120-4063-85fa-02dfe65969be", "type": "topic", "title": "Procurement, Contracts, Vendors, and External Partners", "description": "Explain how projects use contracts, sourcing, vendor management, procurement ethics, and supplier performance governance.", "children": [{"id": "9bcb8637-2b28-480c-b1b4-3740720fc751", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Procurement planning", "children": [{"id": "71aea1f9-e6c0-4c23-b773-b440de45d2b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Make-buy analysis"}, {"id": "e5ed0c1f-fc19-4d8d-ba88-a3ea9da8a848", "type": "concept", "title": "Procurement plan"}, {"id": "0a62acbe-46d9-4a3a-9945-3d449e93a19b", "type": "concept", "title": "Statement of work"}, {"id": "7b62af77-f898-4eeb-8b58-484e22eb5a06", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier selection"}], "description": "Gist: Projects often depend on external partners, materials, services, or technology."}, {"id": "5534520f-4095-4fe4-9500-f50aeef716b7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Contract types", "children": [{"id": "91c1dd33-a88b-4566-bf04-890d62ef142f", "type": "concept", "title": "Fixed price"}, {"id": "08570d80-2d6a-4041-8214-38c9511589c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Time and materials"}, {"id": "a1d550ef-63b9-413d-9992-a94a21e016b6", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost reimbursable"}, {"id": "dcdb7070-0db2-427a-8469-72f6497c023f", "type": "concept", "title": "Incentive contracts"}], "description": "Gist: Contract structure shapes incentives, risk, flexibility, and control."}, {"id": "560e9bee-cb92-4cb4-829c-e3af9bc80aa4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Vendor governance", "children": [{"id": "22d2e955-12bb-4326-adfc-9eca9caf4863", "type": "concept", "title": "Service levels"}, {"id": "89ffdce6-6742-44dd-ba8e-c3d342327e48", "type": "concept", "title": "Deliverable review"}, {"id": "7c8e2b65-076e-4a38-a564-f03a970a64cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Change orders"}, {"id": "55ad0034-8ad5-4fda-87df-e89b38d95dc1", "type": "concept", "title": "Supplier scorecards"}], "description": "Gist: Teams need mechanisms to manage performance, changes, and disputes."}]}, {"id": "355fb352-5939-4499-9c77-3d16adbd28d7", "type": "topic", "title": "Agile, Scrum, Kanban, Waterfall, and Hybrid Delivery", "description": "Compare predictive, adaptive, and hybrid approaches and when each fits project uncertainty, product complexity, and stakeholder needs.", "children": [{"id": "1bb7a5c3-d699-4dc6-855b-b0139b07424c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Predictive delivery", "children": [{"id": "c145f6da-0cab-4818-9426-eb3fb217ca27", "type": "concept", "title": "Phase gates"}, {"id": "903d9dc3-ea39-45a8-a544-bf8b298beaeb", "type": "concept", "title": "Baseline control"}, {"id": "1b382e15-9eb3-4446-a75d-23b4b0b0c13e", "type": "concept", "title": "Formal signoff"}, {"id": "8628b58a-9105-4308-a8dc-de1f83f79895", "type": "concept", "title": "Sequential planning"}], "description": "Gist: Waterfall approaches fit contexts where requirements and work are relatively stable."}, {"id": "2e8f4b4f-fb49-4e26-8098-afbf39b83d94", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adaptive delivery", "children": [{"id": "752ee1c7-3c70-485b-8d1b-c75dda66f64b", "type": "concept", "title": "Scrum"}, {"id": "c12f3329-3574-45de-a8c4-a76c9410be8c", "type": "concept", "title": "Kanban"}, {"id": "6f0f40fd-dbdd-409b-8ba5-0cf5c3bb104d", "type": "concept", "title": "Backlog"}, {"id": "e4a5d4c3-cda2-4be2-81d2-3be73ea5d6b1", "type": "concept", "title": "Sprint review"}], "description": "Gist: Agile approaches fit uncertainty, learning, and iterative product discovery."}, {"id": "d5813e5a-1314-4e3a-bdd5-f09d7912acb1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Hybrid delivery", "children": [{"id": "a88bdb2f-2645-41ee-a3a8-bad40fd60aa5", "type": "concept", "title": "Hybrid lifecycle"}, {"id": "eb66ce9f-e19a-45fe-8c49-6e4cb56c3d8b", "type": "concept", "title": "Agile at scale"}, {"id": "1ca89e40-7fcb-4f71-94ed-891e6a43bb25", "type": "concept", "title": "Stage-gate agile"}, {"id": "e686db62-eb85-480e-a0c8-d8d7e9da22a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Tailoring"}], "description": "Gist: Many real projects blend governance discipline with iterative execution."}]}, {"id": "512617a6-2106-4353-98ab-9f119122f8d1", "type": "topic", "title": "Project Monitoring, Control, Reporting, and Decision Making", "description": "Build control discipline through dashboards, change control, escalation, status reporting, and corrective action.", "children": [{"id": "d723e158-df7d-473f-92be-9e103ccf8cbf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Performance tracking", "children": [{"id": "de81adb6-b1a6-4191-8228-c769d9db9ecb", "type": "concept", "title": "Status reports"}, {"id": "61f1331d-b65f-4756-9c34-8591bab722a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Variance"}, {"id": "ab78ea0e-5393-4366-945d-44b120987fc5", "type": "concept", "title": "Trend analysis"}, {"id": "0cd679c9-d369-47f6-9f90-5b2d1c78ab27", "type": "concept", "title": "Forecasts"}], "description": "Gist: Project control compares actual work against baselines and expectations."}, {"id": "74edfa68-d43d-4d30-962f-c80e45a50ee3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Change control", "children": [{"id": "54fc3631-30eb-4e34-8d27-42686d7c524f", "type": "concept", "title": "Change request"}, {"id": "3dd2f9c3-7a59-440f-8cca-91dedcb4cd32", "type": "concept", "title": "Impact analysis"}, {"id": "0fb2ba27-1641-4292-b9a4-f869a71d7fe3", "type": "concept", "title": "Change control board"}, {"id": "86cf61e3-e858-489e-a43f-279c9aceb93a", "type": "concept", "title": "Baseline update"}], "description": "Gist: Change is managed through disciplined evaluation rather than reflexive yes or no."}, {"id": "9225c2a4-0e89-4453-85ca-ebcd7cd25ca8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Decision making", "children": [{"id": "26bb1ba6-6746-4ff5-8844-6a279072a714", "type": "concept", "title": "Decision log"}, {"id": "370a4a01-e007-4524-8492-f23071bfce4c", "type": "concept", "title": "Issue log"}, {"id": "e23dd61a-de44-4a0b-932d-4ccb12436837", "type": "concept", "title": "Escalation triggers"}, {"id": "54377e1d-c45f-4367-9071-6cf0782c1140", "type": "concept", "title": "Corrective action"}], "description": "Gist: Teams need timely decisions and clear escalation when facts change."}]}, {"id": "ea49b641-d001-411c-ba3d-0ba071a46c41", "type": "topic", "title": "Technology, Tools, Data, and Project Information Systems", "description": "Use project information systems, collaboration tools, analytics, and AI responsibly to support planning and execution.", "children": [{"id": "3d8ca51a-1cb0-4edc-8899-9048d4f3c41a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project tools", "children": [{"id": "833193bb-3061-476d-8edf-704aa6ec31a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Gantt tools"}, {"id": "4297b057-5337-476d-b0d6-f55155232edd", "type": "concept", "title": "Kanban boards"}, {"id": "90f16c1f-8c68-48f1-becd-e3216dea9ca9", "type": "concept", "title": "Document repositories"}, {"id": "a16b95ab-011f-4c40-9dc1-11fd56d16ab6", "type": "concept", "title": "Collaboration platforms"}], "description": "Gist: Tools support planning, communication, collaboration, and traceability."}, {"id": "e026a5a2-deb4-4ef9-9525-69fb0a257924", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Data and dashboards", "children": [{"id": "63d2ff54-1b9a-4874-af18-26f218c3fb65", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule dashboard"}, {"id": "92a2ca28-78ee-43fd-bb46-15ae78ecd0c4", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk heat map"}, {"id": "cf3bccd0-83d1-4d92-b4b1-d4ca4faa42a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Budget tracker"}, {"id": "e244d785-d0a6-41e0-8fbc-6c6790210750", "type": "concept", "title": "Benefits tracker"}], "description": "Gist: Project data should improve decisions, not create reporting theater."}, {"id": "55c6925c-75ff-473e-a717-8afb7bc4823a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "AI and automation", "children": [{"id": "23ffb9f5-b336-4ed4-8260-32fc86db0d29", "type": "concept", "title": "Prompting"}, {"id": "3387f4a4-a3cf-4082-8a8b-668f39bb33cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Data quality"}, {"id": "62434d99-8171-476d-aa81-7e541e96cd63", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy"}, {"id": "749cf611-2ab1-4b13-810d-f55b503da580", "type": "concept", "title": "Human accountability"}], "description": "Gist: AI can support drafting, summarization, risk sensing, and planning but requires human review."}]}, {"id": "a68f2217-915b-4023-a382-fbce43dc0922", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethics, Sustainability, Equity, and Professional Practice", "description": "Examine professional responsibility, fairness, safety, sustainability, transparency, and accountability in project decisions.", "children": [{"id": "7246db7f-5267-44e4-a1fd-9a42b147b0fb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional ethics", "children": [{"id": "dd140026-8a65-412d-81f2-574b9c7e0227", "type": "concept", "title": "Transparency"}, {"id": "c51d9b82-6fe3-4c34-8968-99acd1de7982", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflict of interest"}, {"id": "71db97fa-11a7-43a5-b38f-acb83377d705", "type": "concept", "title": "Honest reporting"}, {"id": "3d65502b-34e3-4f11-b21b-a979aacb3c51", "type": "concept", "title": "Duty of care"}], "description": "Gist: Project managers handle truth, tradeoffs, pressure, and public consequences."}, {"id": "e059ede2-c147-4f27-856c-5083a095510c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainability", "children": [{"id": "cce49307-18a2-4702-88fa-70d6587c0086", "type": "concept", "title": "Lifecycle impacts"}, {"id": "1ad337d3-58b0-4d84-907c-3cfa3c8d088b", "type": "concept", "title": "Waste"}, {"id": "c0ff56d0-8eeb-4675-af19-359618159d04", "type": "concept", "title": "Carbon"}, {"id": "071b1307-26e2-4c5f-9b31-c3cd2da33bfc", "type": "concept", "title": "Responsible procurement"}], "description": "Gist: Projects should consider environmental, social, and long-term operational impacts."}, {"id": "96a2af4d-e0c5-4a4e-ad1a-db821a625204", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Inclusive practice", "children": [{"id": "df91ebbd-7a12-4500-b752-2e4322ec0fe7", "type": "concept", "title": "Accessibility"}, {"id": "0d4470e3-deb7-4387-822e-8a73dd728cd8", "type": "concept", "title": "Equity lens"}, {"id": "c4e0c4c1-c8b0-4007-9340-17d34d18db1f", "type": "concept", "title": "Community impact"}, {"id": "c79ff0bb-bded-430b-a846-ef46709ebb62", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder voice"}], "description": "Gist: Good project management includes affected people in design, implementation, and review."}]}, {"id": "34c0eb9b-bcf7-4367-8aac-0f48baa7e9dc", "type": "topic", "title": "Capstone: Integrated Project Plan and Executive Review", "description": "Synthesize the course through a complete project plan, risk and stakeholder strategy, schedule, budget, governance, and executive presentation.", "children": [{"id": "c3392973-be60-45d9-9037-60653c4a2d29", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Integrated plan", "children": [{"id": "0537f583-0918-40b3-b72e-4c65844ecbce", "type": "concept", "title": "Charter"}, {"id": "f07ebe6d-7460-4468-9982-f1c515325c9e", "type": "concept", "title": "Scope and WBS"}, {"id": "cc58d6b5-1ffe-41af-b0dc-3f3fdf7e1f8b", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule"}, {"id": "6b60b1e9-3954-466d-bb5e-16a72081837c", "type": "concept", "title": "Budget"}], "description": "Gist: Students combine the full planning toolkit into one coherent project baseline."}, {"id": "ac9e38cb-36ad-4990-ba64-f1dce78c5fdd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk and stakeholder strategy", "children": [{"id": "c38701a0-9a2b-4f8d-8571-21f3ff19b352", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder plan"}, {"id": "80778f54-62c6-4634-a6f2-5bc8866e5779", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk register"}, {"id": "d7091f0d-8407-4e11-8343-b9020ec5bcf4", "type": "concept", "title": "Communication plan"}, {"id": "e6e60f3c-bd3d-4ef3-aa5c-c10b47ce05a5", "type": "concept", "title": "Governance model"}], "description": "Gist: The capstone tests whether students can manage human and uncertainty dimensions together."}, {"id": "cc7ff9ac-6595-4867-a470-4f934fcb769c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Executive review", "children": [{"id": "45d5b124-ecb2-45ed-abdd-00790df63fb8", "type": "concept", "title": "Business case"}, {"id": "171e8d19-ab7c-414f-99c6-66a83aba574c", "type": "concept", "title": "Dashboard"}, {"id": "00a58bdc-1823-41cf-b82e-edf76427d894", "type": "concept", "title": "Recommendation"}, {"id": "c2baf650-08e0-4112-86fc-e786fa9a40d4", "type": "concept", "title": "Lessons learned"}], "description": "Gist: Students present tradeoffs and decisions in a concise executive-ready format."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$pmgtjson$::jsonb,
  true,
  false,
  'course',
  'public'
where not exists (
  select 1 from public.learning_paths where slug = 'project-management'
