icated teams"}, {"id": "3878898d-e956-4325-88f2-f253a5fedd9c", "type": "concept", "title": "Distributed teams"}], "description": "Gist: Team design shapes coordination speed, accountability, and decision quality."}, {"id": "091ae07a-d60f-49dd-96d9-53dcd1c36bc3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capacity constraints", "children": [{"id": "607e4b13-521b-4343-a916-3901fc623d8c", "type": "concept", "title": "Resource leveling"}, {"id": "7eb6fc08-5fcb-4c9f-8068-5cdb19edfd00", "type": "concept", "title": "Resource smoothing"}, {"id": "9f9f38ec-8b62-49b1-860c-90311561ded6", "type": "concept", "title": "Critical chain"}, {"id": "a0609295-cc0b-4e33-b002-a99f07cf30e8", "type": "concept", "title": "WIP limits"}], "description": "Gist: Students learn why bottlenecks and multitasking can damage delivery."}]}, {"id": "4d429be0-b065-4562-8a4e-80fed631ebef", "type": "topic", "title": "Risk, Uncertainty, Issue, and Opportunity Management", "description": "Prepare students to identify, assess, prioritize, respond to, and monitor project risk and uncertainty.", "children": [{"id": "ef4cc00f-c7dc-433b-b1a9-a3cb1a950b25", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk identification", "children": [{"id": "8fdb888f-8cfd-4a1a-8592-632d2ac010db", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk register"}, {"id": "5758ec2f-ad2d-497d-a81e-6bb78ae93c76", "type": "concept", "title": "Cause-risk-effect"}, {"id": "15fe03ba-c693-4c22-9b4e-46861e3b2314", "type": "concept", "title": "Assumptions log"}, {"id": "26fe191e-9080-4c4d-bbf9-e0025372f1db", "type": "concept", "title": "Early warning signs"}], "description": "Gist: Risk work begins by naming uncertain events before they become surprises."}, {"id": "b2003f3c-3a1c-4437-86b9-c1f1d4a41043", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk assessment", "children": [{"id": "ce695b26-c328-4e68-9bf6-836ff795baa3", "type": "concept", "title": "Probability-impact matrix"}, {"id": "c0e7b0b9-f168-49df-a98c-8e513efe7d8d", "type": "concept", "title": "Expected value"}, {"id": "d18bb71f-2af8-4a41-b